<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Wiese raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Wiese raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term recommendation on Banco Wiese to accumulate from neutral and left the long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's New York Stock Exchange-listed rose 1/8 to 6-3/4.</p>
</text>
